  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  DISQ   LABEL RECORD IS STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     BLOCK CONTAINS 10 RECORDS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         RECORD CONTAINS 120 CHARACTERS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>            DATA RECORD  IS ZDISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  ZDISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 CLEF PIC X(17).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 FILLER PIC X(103).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CTR     PIC  9(10)  COMP  VALUE  0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  REP     PIC  X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  MAXBDE  PIC  9(10)   COMP  VALUE   99999999.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  MES1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 FILLER  PIC X(19) VALUE 'NB.ARTICLES ECRITS='.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 CTR-1   PIC 9(7).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        06 FILLER  PIC  X(120).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  ZBUF1      REDEFINES  ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         02 RKEY1 PIC X(17).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         02 FILLER PIC X(103).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT  BDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN  INPUT   DISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LOW-VALUES    TO CLEF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ DISQ INTO ZBUF AT END GO TO FBDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD  1  TO  CTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  ZBDE  FROM ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  CTR  TO  CTR-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO DEBF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CLOS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  BDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  DISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP  RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FBDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  'FIN DE FICHIER' UPON  CONSOLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE   CTR   TO CTR-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  MES1   UPON  CONSOLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO  CLOS.
